/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 209 0 R
/E (I would like to express my sincere gratitude to School of Sustainability IIT Madras for offering me the opportunity. I deeply appreciate my Reporting Officer, Dr Charuta Kulkarni, Principal Scientist at School of Sustainability \(SoS\), and Dr Rahul Muralidharan, R&D Specialist at the Energy Consortium for their unwavering support and guidance throughout my internship. Despite their busy schedules, I am immensely grateful for their consistent guidance and invaluable insights. I also thank Ms. Iswatha, Executive Support at SoS for her administrative help during my internship program. I also want to thank Dr Dhanya Bhaskar, Winter Internship Chairperson at the Indian Institute of Forest Management \(IIFM\), Bhopal, for providing this opportunity, and the Winter Internship Cell for their efforts in making the internship process seamless. I would like to extend my sincere thanks to IIFM Professors Dr Yogesh Dubey and Anup Prakash Upadhaya, and my faculty mentor, Dr Santanu Das from IIFM, Bhopal, for his extreme support and guidance throughout my winter Internship. My sincere thanks to the faculty members of the IIFM, Bhopal, and everyone who directly or indirectly supported me in completing this work successfully. Lastly, I would like to thank my co-interns, Sydala Revathi, Harshit Makode, and Vedtida for their kind and sincere help in various aspects of my internship program.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
