/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 210 0 R
/T (Meanwhile, global capital markets are rapidly integrating nature-related dependencies and risks. Frameworks such as the Taskforce on Nature-related Financial Disclosures \(TNFD\), International Sustainability Standards Board \(ISSB\), and Science Based Targets for Nature \(SBTN\) are becoming baseline expectations for investor credibility and market access. Indian businesses that fail to align risk marginalization in global value chains, while early adopters stand to gain from reputational distinction, regulatory readiness, and preferred access to green capital.)
/E (Meanwhile, global capital markets are rapidly integrating nature-related dependencies and risks. Frameworks such as the Taskforce on Nature-related Financial Disclosures \(TNFD\), International Sustainability Standards Board \(ISSB\), and Science Based Targets for Nature \(SBTN\) are becoming baseline expectations for investor credibility and market access. Indian businesses that fail to align risk marginalization in global value chains, while early adopters stand to gain from reputational distinction, regulatory readiness, and preferred access to green capital.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
