/T (While nature-related risks are global, their impacts are shaped by local social and economic structures \(Fig. 5\). In India, where large segments of employment and GDP depend directly on land, water, and climate stability, the nature-related risks for Indian businesses are concentrated and widespread at a time. In 2024 businesses experienced nature-related disruptions, Chennai's floods disrupted automotive supply chains, Maharashtra's drought stressed water-intensive agro-aligned industries, and Kerala's landslides damaged infrastructure [24]. It is, thus crucial to understand the sector-specific dependencies as well as risks in the context of India.)
/E (While nature-related risks are global, their impacts are shaped by local social and economic structures \(Fig. 5\). In India, where large segments of employment and GDP depend directly on land, water, and climate stability, the nature-related risks for Indian businesses are concentrated and widespread at a time. In 2024 businesses experienced nature-related disruptions, Chennai's floods disrupted automotive supply chains, Maharashtra's drought stressed water-intensive agro-aligned industries, and Kerala's landslides damaged infrastructure [24]. It is, thus crucial to understand the sector-specific dependencies as well as risks in the context of India.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
