/T (In 2022 alone, approximately USD 7 trillion flowed into nature-negative activities, including USD 1.7 trillion in environmentally harmful public subsidies and USD 5 trillion in private finance, far exceeding the roughly USD 200 billion invested in nature-positive activities, of which less than 20% originated from private sources [38]. In effect, for every dollar invested in protecting nature, more than thirty dollars continue to finance its degradation.)
