>>
endobj
506 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 224 0 R
/E (Challenges and Next Steps)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
507 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 224 0 R
/E (While the partnership between Hindalco and UltraTech represents a successful cross-group collaboration, it remains the only major example. The group has identified two practical problems hindering wider adoption: \(1\) many companies do not know which waste streams can replace raw materials at similar or lower cost, and \(2\) buyers often view taking waste as doing sellers a favor, creating pricing mismatches. Aditya Birla Group is actively involved in forums like WBCSD and FICCI to explore circular economy opportunities with other businesses [53].)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
