/T (Even with intent, the firms especially MSMEs, lack expertise or capital to act on nature. Financing smaller nature projects is challenging, as many sustainability-linked loans and bonds are too large or complex for mid-size firms. Scaling up requires aggregation, portfolio debt funds, blended finance, and technical assistance [38].)
/E (Even with intent, the firms especially MSMEs, lack expertise or capital to act on nature. Financing smaller nature projects is challenging, as many sustainability-linked loans and bonds are too large or complex for mid-size firms. Scaling up requires aggregation, portfolio debt funds, blended finance, and technical assistance [38].)
