530 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 226 0 R
/T (In India, biodiversity governance is structured through the National Biodiversity Authority \(NBA\), State Biodiversity Boards \(SBBs\), and local Biodiversity Management Committees \(BMCs\), creating a fragmented landscape. SBBs across India vary dramatically in capacity, enforcement priorities, and interpretation of rules. Legal ambiguities persist regarding benefit-sharing obligations for Indian entities using biological resources [67].)
/E (In India, biodiversity governance is structured through the National Biodiversity Authority \(NBA\), State Biodiversity Boards \(SBBs\), and local Biodiversity Management Committees \(BMCs\), creating a fragmented landscape. SBBs across India vary dramatically in capacity, enforcement priorities, and interpretation of rules. Legal ambiguities persist regarding benefit-sharing obligations for Indian entities using biological resources [67].)
