/Title (In light of these global appeals, this white paper explores how the concept of nature-positive business has emerged in response to the challenges of day. Before offering scenarios and potential solutions, it examines the underlying reasons why nature has remained economically invisible \(Box 2\), how such invisibility is beginning to be accounted for, and what early responses from businesses, policymakers, and financial institutions reveal about the new wave.)
