/Title (The concept of "nature-positive" has recently emerged from the widespread recognition on the global scale at which nature is being lost and the threat this poses to the collective survival of humanity [1]. Nature-positive is a global societal goal to halt and reverse the loss of nature across all four realms \(water, biodiversity, air/climate, and soil/land\), for the benefit of human and planetary well-being \(Fig. 1\) [2].)
